    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/octopus-energy-group/data-engineer-fokus-messdatenmanagement-ownership-berlin-de-197367> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-data-engineer-keynsham-bristol-england-420378> a prov:Entity,
