    schema:title "Graduate Fullstack Engineer" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/allica-bank/graduate-fullstack-engineer-milton-keynes-247463> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-graduate-operations-supervisor-viernheim-hesse-52419> a prov:Entity,
