            schema:name "Schweinfurt" ] ;
    schema:title "IT-Mitarbeiter / IT Support & Business Central (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/r-raymon-bicycles-gmbh/it-mitarbeiter-it-support-business-central-schweinfurt-253361> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-it-systemadministrator-windows-server-frankfurt-am-main-31312> a prov:Entity,
