    schema:datePosted "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "What does it mean to be a Consultant at Netlight? Join the Netlight Berlin team as a consultant and be a part of shaping the software products and technical solutions of today and tomorrow alongside your colleagues and clients. Our focus is not just on the digital product, but also on the team and the business impact. You'll have the ownership to carve your own career path, choosing from a range of clients and roles based on your personal experience, strengths, interests, and market demand. Our projects encompass a wide technical spectrum, including fullstack development, backend, data engineering, cloud solutions, architecture, web development, DevOps, and more. Instead of predefined roles, we tailor positions to fit individuals. At Netlight, you define your career path, clients you engage with, your role (based on your strengths, interests, and experience), and your connections with mentors, coaches, EDGE networks, and social circles. The possibilities are endless. Come build the future with us at Netlight. Who you are Soon-to-be/recent Graduate (2026/27) with a relevant Master’s Degree in Computer Science, IT, Business Informatics or similar (or Bachelor's Degree + ≥2yrs of full-time experience) Full business-level fluency in English Some hands-on industry experience through internships, working student roles or full-time in Software Engineering with modern technologies, (e.g. Fullstack Development, Backend, Data Engineering, Cloud Solutions, Architecture, Web Development, DevOps, or similar) Based in Berlin or willingness to relocate to Berlin (for other locations, please apply to our other openings) We offer Possibility to be part of growing one of the most successful tech consultancies in the industry Diverse client landscape, incl. some of the most innovative tech companies & exciting projects with lots of room for professional development Access to an international network of 2200+ highly talented individuals An experienced mentor and a professional coach to guide you throughout your career An international & diverse working environment with a central and modern office space Competitive and transparent salary model with equal pay regardless of the assignment, biannual salary reviews, and attractive benefits (e.g. company shares, Deutschlandticket, parental benefits & much more) About us Netlight is an international digital consulting firm, helping leading companies to succeed in the digital landscape, from advice to implementation. Our service contains the collective intelligence of more than 2,200 consultants offering a comprehensive range of digital services, from strategy to technology. Co-creating the future today, since 1999. Netlight has been awarded several times for profitable growth and management, as a top employer, and for our engagement in Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion. Located in Stockholm, Gothenburg, Oslo, Helsinki, Copenhagen, Munich, Hamburg, Berlin, Frankfurt, Zurich, Cologne, Amsterdam, Madrid, Toronto and London. Come work with us Netlight as a company strives to be a truly diverse, equitable, and inclusive organisation. Regardless of who you are, what personality, background, and experience you have, you enrich our culture through your values. Netlight’s purpose is to unleash full potential, realise great careers, and fulfil personal growth. To achieve this, we have a highly engaged network organisation, where every employee gets a mentor, delivery coach, and personal communities. The key to our continued success is trust and personal responsibility, diverse experiences, challenging opportunities, and development based on personal values. Every Netlighter is an active part of building and shaping this culture, which leads to a clear correlation between personal growth and the growth of Netlight. Ready to shape the future with us? If we find that your profile matches what we are looking for, you will hear from us within two weeks of applying. Submit your application today—we’re excited to get to know you! Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
